  "body": "## Changelog\n\n## 🔄 Changes\n- cd945f4 🏁 Releasing version 1.0.0.CR4 (GitHub Action)\n- 7bb8952 #476 Build fix (Gunnar Morling)\n- f85035e #476 Removing superfluous dependency (Gunnar Morling)\n- ae62e7d #476 Build fix (Gunnar Morling)\n- 7753ccc #476 Build fix (Gunnar Morling)\n- da1b668 Bump net.revelc.code.formatter:formatter-maven-plugin (dependabot[bot])\n- c077f3c #471 Upgrading to Quarkus 3.8.6 (Gunnar Morling)\n- 6375658 #469 Support for Debezium 3.x container images; (Gunnar Morling)\n- c5bfedc Bump org.apache.maven.plugins:maven-compiler-plugin (dependabot[bot])\n- c93e778 #461 Adjusting test to new Debezium plug-ins (Gunnar Morling)\n- 9fae581 README (Gunnar Morling)\n- ea250ca No target=\"_blank\" for you in GH-flavoured Markdown :( (Gunnar Morling)\n- 5209c48 Larger image (Gunnar Morling)\n- 1a9ccdd Adding new video (Gunnar Morling)\n- 5803c94 🔧 #437 Build macos-aarch64 binaries with free GH hosted runners (#439) (Andres Almiray)\n- 061c858 🧹 Various Java cleanups (Mickael Maison)\n- 64560de 🔧 #430 Use /connectors/<CONNECTOR>/tasks for task configs (Mickael Maison)\n- 4efd6b6 #340 Using SPDX license header (Gunnar Morling)\n- 162a1de #399 Adding support for kcctl config remove-context (Xavier Pisco)\n- cbdbd29 Fix early-access workflow breakage due to wrong keyword (Andres Almiray)\n- 5b5ccd5 #422 Fix NPE for 'kcctl patch offsets' without payload (Chris Egerton)\n- 667aac3 #424 Add DeleteOffsetsCommand as subcommand of DeleteCommand (Chris Egerton)\n- d29c5d5 Update upload/download GH actions to v4 (Andres Almiray)\n- b815ef4 Streamline build and package jobs in GH workflows (Andres Almiray)\n- f58b8b0 Refactor duplication of release configuration (Andres Almiray)\n- 3f9f4da ⬆️  Next version 1.0.0-SNAPSHOT (GitHub Action)\n\n## ⚙️ Dependencies\n- 608470e Bump org.jreleaser:jreleaser-maven-plugin from 1.11.0 to 1.15.0 (dependabot[bot])\n- e7b114f Bump org.apache.maven.plugins:maven-assembly-plugin from 3.6.0 to 3.7.1 (dependabot[bot])\n- 049b134 Bump quarkus.platform.version from 3.8.1 to 3.8.2 (dependabot[bot])\n- 78c2fa7 Bump org.jreleaser:jreleaser-maven-plugin from 1.10.0 to 1.11.0 (#453) (dependabot[bot])\n- 16a52fc Bump quarkus.platform.version from 3.7.4 to 3.8.1 (#452) (dependabot[bot])\n- b5e3a28 Bump debezium.version from 2.5.1.Final to 2.5.2.Final (#451) (dependabot[bot])\n- 756259a Bump net.javacrumbs.json-unit:json-unit-assertj from 3.2.5 to 3.2.7 (dependabot[bot])\n- 41e5fb2 Bump quarkus.platform.version from 3.7.3 to 3.7.4 (dependabot[bot])\n- a3300c1 Bump quarkus.platform.version from 3.7.2 to 3.7.3 (dependabot[bot])\n- 64433d7 Bump com.squareup.okio:okio from 3.7.0 to 3.8.0 (dependabot[bot])\n- df32fab Bump net.javacrumbs.json-unit:json-unit-assertj from 3.2.4 to 3.2.5 (dependabot[bot])\n- a0da615 Bump quarkus.platform.version from 3.7.1 to 3.7.2 (dependabot[bot])\n- fb0f808 Bump net.javacrumbs.json-unit:json-unit-assertj from 3.2.2 to 3.2.4 (dependabot[bot])\n- 33a488c Bump org.assertj:assertj-core from 3.25.2 to 3.25.3 (dependabot[bot])\n- 712cff8 Bump debezium.version from 2.5.0.Final to 2.5.1.Final (#438) (dependabot[bot])\n- 2a427c5 Bump quarkus.platform.version from 3.6.8 to 3.7.1 (dependabot[bot])\n- d0830d2 Bump quarkus.platform.version from 3.6.6 to 3.6.8 (dependabot[bot])\n- a294b36 Bump styfle/cancel-workflow-action from 0.12.0 to 0.12.1 (dependabot[bot])\n- fb5b061 Bump org.assertj:assertj-core from 3.25.1 to 3.25.2 (dependabot[bot])\n\n\n## Contributors\nWe'd like to thank the following people for their contributions:\nAndres Almiray, Chris Egerton, GitHub, GitHub Action, Gunnar Morling, Mickael Maison, Xavier Pisco, dependabot[bot]"
}
